{
  "bookId": "activity-extra-2023summer",
  "id": "source-38001",
  "sections": [
    {
      "blocks": [
        {
          "noticeKind": "placeholder",
          "text": "原文中的动态称谓保留为占位符：|101|＝玩家昵称。",
          "type": "notice"
        }
      ],
      "id": "reading-note",
      "title": "阅读说明"
    },
    {
      "blocks": [
        {
          "sourceId": "38001001",
          "sourceType": 9,
          "text": "在某个平凡的夏日——",
          "type": "narration"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "38001002",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "仓田真乃",
          "text": "主人，今天的风很凉快呢~",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "38001003",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "椰冰小狐",
          "text": "啾咪，啾咪！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "options": [
            {
              "targetId": "38001005",
              "text": "眼熟的狐狸出现了"
            },
            {
              "targetId": "38001005",
              "text": "它在说什么？"
            }
          ],
          "sourceId": "38001004",
          "sourceType": 4,
          "text": "",
          "type": "choice"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "38001005",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "仓田真乃",
          "text": "「说到夏天果然还是要有泳装」，它是这么说的哦。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "options": [
            {
              "targetId": "38001007",
              "text": "……"
            }
          ],
          "sourceId": "38001006",
          "sourceType": 4,
          "text": "",
          "type": "choice"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "38001007",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "仓田真乃",
          "text": "游泳部的成员已经在泳池附近集合了。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "options": [
            {
              "targetId": "38001009",
              "text": "游泳部?"
            },
            {
              "targetId": "38001009",
              "text": "我怎么不知道？"
            }
          ],
          "sourceId": "38001008",
          "sourceType": 4,
          "text": "",
          "type": "choice"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "38001009",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "仓田真乃",
          "text": "是手办社区里新成立的「夏季限定」组织，旨在让大家重温愉快的校园生活。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "options": [
            {
              "targetId": "38001011",
              "text": "感觉有点随便……"
            },
            {
              "targetId": "38001011",
              "text": "感觉有点意思……"
            }
          ],
          "sourceId": "38001010",
          "sourceType": 4,
          "text": "",
          "type": "choice"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "38001011",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "仓田真乃",
          "text": "啊哈哈哈……就让我向主人介绍下这些部员吧。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "38001012",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "仓田真乃",
          "text": "首先是游泳部的部长，曾经在海底与巨大章鱼搏斗的阳子姐！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "38001013",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "夏澄阳子",
          "text": "唷，|101|。等下和我还有彩音一起去潜水，怎么样？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "38001014",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "仓田真乃",
          "text": "然后是游泳部的指导老师，人称「冬临之光」的海伦女士。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "38001015",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "海伦",
          "text": "你来了。在这里即使什么都不做，也感觉心情很愉快呢。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "38001016",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "仓田真乃",
          "text": "游泳部的会计，拥有自己的冰饮店的泉小姐。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "38001017",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "泉",
          "text": "今天的冰棍可是免费不限量供应哦。|101|，要来一根吗？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "38001018",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "仓田真乃",
          "text": "曾获沙雕大赛冠军的葵同学，她真的很喜欢晒太阳呢~",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "38001019",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "葵",
          "text": "ZZZZZZZZ……光合作用……",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "38001020",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "仓田真乃",
          "text": "啊……还在睡觉……",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "38001021",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "仓田真乃",
          "text": "咳，接下来，普通部员的吕布。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "38001022",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "吕布",
          "text": "啊？为什么一轮到我，介绍就变得这么简单了啊？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "38001023",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "仓田真乃",
          "text": "说起来，还有两名今天刚加入的新成员呢。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "38001024",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "仓田真乃",
          "text": "这位是在M城暂住的贝歌小姐……虽然她好像有点误解了我们的邀请……",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "38001025",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "贝歌",
          "text": "人类……你果然来看我了。真好呢。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "38001026",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "贝歌",
          "text": "此处是名为「游泳竞赛」的黑暗角斗场，你就是来见证我悲惨的末路的吧？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "38001027",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "仓田真乃",
          "text": "……诶？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "38001028",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "椰冰小狐",
          "text": "（狐语）这只半人鱼非常危险啊！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "options": [
            {
              "targetId": "38001030",
              "text": "……"
            }
          ],
          "sourceId": "38001029",
          "sourceType": 4,
          "text": "",
          "type": "choice"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "38001030",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "仓田真乃",
          "text": "啊！贝歌小姐开始换衣服了，我们……去另一位新部员那看看吧。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "38001031",
          "sourceType": 3,
          "text": "铃、铃——",
          "type": "narration"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "38001032",
          "sourceType": 3,
          "text": "熟悉的丽人就在水波荡漾的池边。",
          "type": "narration"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "38001033",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "蔡文姬",
          "text": "主君，您是……什么时候来的?",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "options": [
            {
              "targetId": "38001035",
              "text": "我刚到"
            },
            {
              "targetId": "38001035",
              "text": "没想到你也在这"
            }
          ],
          "sourceId": "38001034",
          "sourceType": 4,
          "text": "",
          "type": "choice"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "38001035",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "蔡文姬",
          "text": "呵……我也是。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "38001036",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "蔡文姬",
          "text": "主君，请帮我扎下头发，可以吗？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "38001037",
          "sourceType": 3,
          "text": "——盛夏的潮风仍将吹拂，似乎永不止歇。",
          "type": "narration"
        }
      ],
